    "Burst clears a small area. Mix gives you a fresh board. Each tool starts with three uses; every three completed puzzles earns one more of each. Hints are always free.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Burst clears a small area. Mix gives you a fresh board. Each tool starts with three uses; every three completed puzzles earns one more of each. Hints are always free."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explosion entfernt ein kleines Gebiet. Mischen erzeugt ein neues Feld. Jede Hilfe startet mit drei Einsätzen; alle drei abgeschlossenen Rätsel bringen je einen weiteren. Hinweise sind immer kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Éclat efface une petite zone. Mélanger renouvelle le plateau. Chaque outil commence avec trois utilisations ; trois défis terminés en ajoutent une de chaque. Les indices sont toujours gratuits."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explodir limpa uma pequena área. Misturar renova o tabuleiro. Cada ferramenta começa com três usos; a cada três desafios concluídos, você ganha mais um de cada. Dicas são sempre gratuitas."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تزيل أداة التفجير مساحة صغيرة، وتعطيك أداة الخلط لوحة جديدة. تبدأ بثلاث مرات لكل أداة، وتكسب مرة إضافية لكل منهما عند إكمال ثلاثة ألغاز. التلميحات مجانية دائمًا."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "爆破可清除小範圍的糖果；重排可換一副新棋盤。每種道具起初可用三次，每完成三個謎題各增加一次。提示不消耗道具。"
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Burst clears a small area. Mix gives you a fresh board. Each tool starts with three uses; every three completed puzzles earns one more of each. Hints are always free."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Burst clears a small area. Mix gives you a fresh board. Each tool starts with three uses; every three completed puzzles earns one more of each. Hints are always free."
          }
        }
      }
    },
